@LOCK PICKING
To initiate lock pick mode, face lock and press OK (key 5). Press UP (key 2), DOWN (key 8), LEFT (key 4), or RIGHT (key 6) to start setting the current tumbler. Press the same key again to finish setting the tumbler. Continue till all tumblers are set.

@LOCKED OBJECTS
Throughout the game you will find locked treasure chests and doors that can be unlocked with your lock picks, a key, or a lever.

